# Teacher's Pet (windurst 28): Moreno-Toeno (Windurst Waters; his script: a random 441 / 469, which takes turns with an
# Event reply: talked to twice where it shows). A level-1 WAR. Available: the two items traded (no trade handler in
# section 1: nothing); 437 (Prog 1); 438 option 1 (Prog 0); 437 again; 438 option 0 (begun). Accepted: 439 (0, Bird
# Feather, Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud); the feather alone, the two with a chip: nil; the two: 440 (250, ...): taken, 250
# gil, completed (fame 10), Making the Grade's mustZone. Completed (repeatable): 439; Making the Grade completed by GM,
# out to Port Windurst and back (both mustZones cleared): Fuepepe's 459; the two traded again: 440, finished with a
# full bag (the reward is fame only, so complete does not fail): completed again, Making the Grade's mustZone set
# again: Fuepepe nil (423).
lists WindurstWaters/Moreno-Toeno/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Moreno-Toeno/onTrade WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/437 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/438 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/440 WindurstWaters/Fuepepe/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=170.5,-1.25,156.9 job=WAR lvl=1
item BoneChip
item BirdFeather x2
item TwoLeafMandragoraBud
item TwoLeafMandragoraBud
login
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # Prog 0: 437 (walks beside him)
finish                                        # Prog 1
trade Moreno-Toeno BirdFeather x1 TwoLeafMandragoraBud x1  # available, the check holds: no trade handler: nothing
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # Prog 1: 438 (0, Bird Feather, Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud)
finish option=1                               # not 0: Prog 0
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # 437
finish                                        # Prog 1
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # 438
finish option=0                               # begun
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # accepted: 439 (the quest's turn)
finish
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # his script's turn: 441
finish
trade Moreno-Toeno BirdFeather x1             # the feather alone: nil
trade Moreno-Toeno BirdFeather x1 TwoLeafMandragoraBud x1 BoneChip x1  # with an extra: nil
trade Moreno-Toeno BirdFeather x1 TwoLeafMandragoraBud x1  # 440 (250, ...)
finish                                        # taken; 250 gil; completed (fame 10); Making the Grade's mustZone
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # completed: 439 (the quest's turn)
finish
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # his script's turn: 469
finish
quest Windurst.MakingTheGrade completed
warp -103.9,-3.25,107.9 PortWindurst          # Making the Grade's mustZone cleared on the zone change
warp 165.5,-1.25,161.1 WindurstWaters         # back
trigger Fuepepe                               # Making the Grade completed, its mustZone clear: 459
finish
trigger Moreno-Toeno                          # 439 (the warps reset the turns: the quest's) (stands beside him)
finish
trade Moreno-Toeno BirdFeather x1 TwoLeafMandragoraBud x1  # completed: 440 again
fill-inventory
finish                                        # a full bag (the reward is fame only: complete cannot fail): taken; 250 gil; completed again; Making the Grade's mustZone set
free-inventory
trigger Fuepepe                               # Making the Grade's mustZone: no section; 423
finish
